sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Claude
  participant M as next-mcp
  participant S as next-services
  M->>M: boot: fetch contract, derive JSON Schema
  C->>M: resources/read events.odcs.yaml
  M-->>C: ODCS contract (types + semantics)
  C->>M: tools/call list_events
  M->>S: GET /api/v1/events
  S-->>M: JSON page
  M->>M: validate vs contract-derived schema
  M-->>C: structured content (schema-conformant)
